{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>In the multitude of people is the king's glory</b> — The bet in ברב and in באפס has the sense of 'because of': because of a numerous people that the king has, people will honor him; and because there is no nation, destruction will come upon him. And it is possible that he was not one who fears Heaven, therefore he has no nation."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:49.941200180Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}